### send Teams custom JSON (content_format=json, params_template 整体作为 payload)
POST {{baseurl}}/template HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "template_name": "teams_custom_json",
    "variables": {
        "id": "12345",
        "title": "告警通知",
        "body": "CPU 使用率过高"
    },
    "recipients": [
        {"channel_type": "teams", "instance": "teams-main", "recipient": ""}
    ]
}
